  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile L2 investigation): mis-parent flagged. Current parent INV-kurup (set during prior unlinked-campaign Phase 1) does not fit — the mechanic is 'hash inputs too coarse' (60% of nodes share stable_id because the hash doesn't include positional/path disambiguating info), which is a UNIQUENESS gap, not a FORMAT gap. INV-kurup's claim is non-canonical identifier FORMATS from emission paths. INV-bazij belongs under a future 'stable_id uniqueness' META (along with INV-zudob and INV-hunup) — deferred filing decision. Parent revert blocked by tracker limitation; will re-parent forward when the new META is filed."  # b553
